<!-- 13 · will you? -->
<section class="slide v ink">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Will you?</b></span><span>13</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">What it actually takes</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:72px">"The reality is that people don't."</h2>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:20px">Not because the code is hard. Because four things have to be there, every day, at once.</p>
  <div class="cols c4" style="margin-top:56px;gap:28px">
    <div class="card g" style="padding:30px 28px"><div class="n">1 · A TEAM</div><h3 style="color:#f6f3ec">People and agents</h3><p>Here: about 25 named agent roles under one human operator, and seven people at the summit.</p></div>
    <div class="card g" style="padding:30px 28px"><div class="n">2 · A STRUCTURE</div><h3 style="color:#f6f3ec">Rules in writing</h3><p>Who owns which path, passes with budgets, decisions as pages, a policy per agent.</p></div>
    <div class="card g" style="padding:30px 28px"><div class="n">3 · A VISION</div><h3 style="color:#f6f3ec">Why it exists</h3><p>Accurate information, kept current, with its provenance; pay after the value; the reader's data stays the reader's.</p></div>
    <div class="card g" style="padding:30px 28px;border-top-color:#ff7a7f"><div class="n">4 · SOMEBODY</div><h3 style="color:#f6f3ec">Who is going to do it</h3><p>Who reads the asks, decides, and is there tomorrow and the day after.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="src" style="color:#9a978f;margin-top:30px">Dinis Cruz, 7 Nov 2026 (board/team/investors/dinis-2026-11-07-go-live-and-structure.md); CLAUDE.md; the thinking on newsroom.sgit.ai.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>Do it yourself</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 14 · or do it with us -->
<section class="slide v">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Or do it with us</b></span><span>14</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">If you have the will and want the head start</div>
  <h2>You do not have to start from a fork.</h2>
  <p class="lead">Dinis Cruz builds the technology underneath, across his open-source startups: the place of highest leverage. <b>PrompTugal needs the people who execute.</b></p>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:56px;gap:36px">
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">JOIN · DECK 7</div><h3>Be part of the founding team</h3><p>A business partner as CEO, ideally senior in the news industry; very technical journalists; strategic people, with equity.</p></div>
    <div class="card c"><div class="n">PARTNER · DECK 3</div><h3>Run it for your world</h3><p>Your event, sector or region. Dual licensing: your own terms, and we maintain it for you.</p></div>
    <div class="card r"><div class="n">INVEST · DECK 5</div><h3>Back the execution</h3><p>Equity in My Feeds, the publisher, for the operations: commercialisation, services, editorial.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="body" style="margin-top:44px">Or help now, this summit week, on the back office: unpaid, with visibility. Web Summit Lisbon, 9 to 12 November 2026.</p>
  <div class="src">Dinis Cruz, 7 Nov 2026; open-source.sgit.ai/practice ("You can always commercial-license or relicense everything for a customer who wants it").</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>Do it yourself</span></div>
</section>

